00:19:31,110 --> 00:19:34,940
has zero-- almost nothing
has zero volatility.

293
00:19:37,490 --> 00:19:45,300
And so indeed-- but in the
pricing theory that Choongbum

294
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:48,890
will be discussing in
