297
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:59,320
a risk-free rate ought to be.

298
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:02,000
And so this particular
portfolio out

299
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,030
to be structured
so that it achieves

300
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:08,310
a return equal to a risk-free
rate, barring transaction costs

301
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:10,280
and frictions and all
that kind of thing.

302
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:12,940
But yeah.

303
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:21,800
OK, so if we increase the
correlation from 0 to 0.4,

304
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:26,130
well, we still get a benefit
of diversification but less.

305
00:20:26,130 --> 00:20:30,240
We're basically not able to
